  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "海湧ê願望"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>莊詠丞</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>M̄是阮m̄肯等，時代已經無仝，查某人mā有家己ê願望，查某人mā有家己ê願望。&nbsp;</b></span><i><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><b>1</b></span></i></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: courier; font-size: large;\">～潘越雲〈純情青春夢〉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">陳莊素芳是阮外媽ê名，細漢ê時tsūn我tiānn-tiānn想無外媽ê名是按怎有四个字，hit-tang-tsūn阮阿母lóng kā我講：「因為ài kap外公仝姓。」M̄-koh就算阿母án-ne解sueh，我iáu是m̄知其中緣故。大漢了後，我tsiah沓沓仔知影是按怎外媽ê名lò-lò長，若回顧歷史，1929年政府公佈ê《民法》第四編第三節第1,000條，是頭擺tī法律講著tuè翁姓&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: xx-small;\"><b><i>2</i></b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">；若是beh深入了解內容，hit个陳--字，ná親像是一種對家庭ê責任，ná親像是一種對翁ê忠貞，ná親像是一款漸漸失去自我ê象徵。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">逐擺過年tńg去外媽ê「澎湖灣」，外媽lóng ē妝kah tsiok suí koh煮tsiok濟山珍海味，就算食材真貴，外媽mā是無第二句話就買--落-來，iáu-m̄-koh he kám是外媽真正ê模樣？Hia-ê菜色kám真正是外媽家己kah意ê喙路？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海口風tī海坪直直吹，陳莊素芳，你是m̄是teh-beh bē記得「莊素芳」生做啥mih款？你ê人生就親像海上ê海湧起起落落，若是有機會，我tsiok想beh kā海湧當做伴奏、陪你做伙唱一首〈純情青春夢〉。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>1.編按：歌詞內容調整做雜誌ê漢羅用字。</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>2.編按：法律原文是『妻以其本姓冠以夫姓。贅夫以其本姓冠以妻姓。但當事人另有訂定者，不在此限。』</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/s1421/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEghXXRLgKj_kjRGhifVnrKVRjwL0KpLScEzwjSifUm_RJ59voh0N7PrTlyCpo5vJLSJhknS648lJrOGaxLs7XsOyqKWjPPUMz6J4RoRyjlA_GI73SPqoOLsq-Mz5wghm1nfibnvNRlFKTUQG8kiCafC1KBR6DrxX6N9smtThcVH7KH5UXDY6bG-BxO-fw/w450-h640/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiX-5RSX7hbaKfWQctPnd_j6N7xtVhobVDV1Q5y7MztaH9OJ3L8PrI1mxH12Fz2DkgxeWN5qbhbi0Kxwxo1JIKJRS6E8OCXY8Y3Xb6pSrv1G7k4oRpaQURzTYkQSO1xTdYVXUzEYgHXEtUoZS0v1TMPqXWqDwfHB_ZKOf2l7EG-NcMj47Yr9m9g5WJqhw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_038.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiX-5RSX7hbaKfWQctPnd_j6N7xtVhobVDV1Q5y7MztaH9OJ3L8PrI1mxH12Fz2DkgxeWN5qbhbi0Kxwxo1JIKJRS6E8OCXY8Y3Xb6pSrv1G7k4oRpaQURzTYkQSO1xTdYVXUzEYgHXEtUoZS0v1TMPqXWqDwfHB_ZKOf2l7EG-NcMj47Yr9m9g5WJqhw/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B